{"code":"sw","quarters":[{"id":"2026-02","title":"Kukua Katika Uhusiano na Mungu","description":"Iwe umekulia katika Kanisa la Waadventista Wasabato au wewe ni mgeni katika imani; iwe umesoma Miongozo mingi au michache ya Kujifunza Biblia ya Shule ya Sabato ya Watu Wazima; na, hatimaye, haijalishi unajikuta wapi kiroho leo, mada ya jinsi ya kukua katika uhusiano wenye maana na Mungu ni muhimu.","human_date":"Aprili · Mei · Juni 2026","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026","color_primary":"#0A454E","color_primary_dark":"#01373F","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Kukagua Uhalisia","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"03/04/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Kumjua Mungu","start_date":"04/04/2026","end_date":"10/04/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Kiburi Dhidi ya Unyenyekevu","start_date":"11/04/2026","end_date":"17/04/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Nafasi ya Biblia","start_date":"18/04/2026","end_date":"24/04/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Jinsi ya Kujifunza Biblia","start_date":"25/04/2026","end_date":"01/05/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Mashujaa wa Maombi","start_date":"02/05/2026","end_date":"08/05/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Maombi Yenye Matokeo","start_date":"09/05/2026","end_date":"15/05/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Kuwa na Imani","start_date":"16/05/2026","end_date":"22/05/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Dhambi, Injili na Sheria","start_date":"23/05/2026","end_date":"29/05/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Toba na Msamaha","start_date":"30/05/2026","end_date":"05/06/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"VIKWAZO","start_date":"06/06/2026","end_date":"12/06/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Shiriki Habari Zake","start_date":"13/06/2026","end_date":"19/06/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Katika Umilele","start_date":"20/06/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-04","title":"Karama Ya Unabii","description":"Wanasayansi wa neva wameanza kuelewa uwezo wa ajabu wa watoto wachanga wa kujifunza lugha. Katika miezi sita, mtoto anaweza kuelewa sauti zinazojumuisha maneno ya Kiingereza, au maneno kutoka kwa lugha nyingine yoyote inayozungumzwa zaidi ya 7,000. Akifunuliwa kwa lugha ya pili, anaweza pia kupata lugha hiyo. Katika kipindi hiki mlango wa ajabu wa kiakili unafunguka, ukiruhusu watoto wachanga kutofautisha sauti arobaini hivi ambazo kwa ujumla huunda lugha ya asili kutoka kwa sauti 800 tofauti wanazoweza kuzielewa wakati wa kuzaliwa. Lakini kuna jambo moja: watoto wachanga lazima wazungumzwe. Unaweza kuiita masomo ya sauti kwa watoto wachanga.","human_date":"Oktoba · Novemba · Desemba 2026","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026","color_primary":"#54292F","color_primary_dark":"#3E1E22","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Muumba Ananena","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"02/10/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Wito wa Nabii","start_date":"03/10/2026","end_date":"09/10/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Manabii wa Agano la Kale","start_date":"10/10/2026","end_date":"16/10/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Manabii wa Agano Jipya","start_date":"17/10/2026","end_date":"23/10/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Ufunuo na Uvuvio","start_date":"24/10/2026","end_date":"30/10/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Maandishi ya Kiunabii","start_date":"31/10/2026","end_date":"06/11/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Sasa Sikia Hili!","start_date":"07/11/2026","end_date":"13/11/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Kufasiri Maandishi ya Kinabii","start_date":"14/11/2026","end_date":"20/11/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Kuwapima Manabii","start_date":"21/11/2026","end_date":"27/11/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Mamlaka ya Kinabii na Umuhimu Wake","start_date":"28/11/2026","end_date":"04/12/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Udhihirisho wa Kinabii katika Nyakati Muhimu Sana","start_date":"05/12/2026","end_date":"11/12/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Udhihirisho wa Kinabii wa Wakati wa Mwisho","start_date":"12/12/2026","end_date":"18/12/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Baraka kutoka katika Neno la Kinabii","start_date":"19/12/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-03","titl